(text "J8 is a CUSTOM 2.54 mm service header.\nPin 1 is a 3.3 V reference OUTPUT only.\nUse a 3.3 V SWD / UART adapter and shared GND.\nBOOT0 normally low; JP1 is momentary reset.\nCAN PA11/PA12 use AF4. LEDs are on CAN sheet." (at 246 225 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9881a4af-6df3-504f-9b59-fefefb278c49"))
